Modifications and additions in this repository include:
- New safety-filter research code: SAFTER_src/, SAFTER_scripts/
- New high-level RL packages: src/high_level_rl/, src/high_level_bcbf_sac/,
  src/high_level_control/, src/high_level_sac/, src/high_level_cbf_rl/,
  src/timeout90_overlay/
- New task config/assets: src/tasks/velocity/mdp/cbf_filter.py,
  src/tasks/velocity/config/go2/obstacle_cfg.py, and additional MJCF scenes
  under src/assets/robots/unitree_go2/xmls/
- Research/evaluation scripts under scripts/
- Modifications to setup.py, src/assets/robots/unitree_go2/xmls/go2.xml,
  and src/tasks/velocity/config/go2/ (env_cfgs.py, __init__.py)

The original locomotion/simulation baseline (robot assets, task configs,
simulation plumbing under src/, doc/, deploy/, simulate/) is unmodified
upstream code except where noted above.
